        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 565RT, Beveled Half Round Knob with Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 565RT made by <a href=\"/collections/omnia\"><b>Omnia Industries</b></a> adds graceful beauty to any space. The Chic Half Round Knob With Rectangular Rose is a great combination of old and new with a traditional knob and a modern style rose. That makes it perfect for any home no matter the decor. It is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors. Available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 565RT Beveled Half Round Knob with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 565RT Beveled Half Round Knob with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Chic Half Round Knob With Rectangular Rose, Omnia 565RT",
                "description": "Half Round Knobset, Omnia 565RT - The 565RT made by Omnia adds graceful beauty to any space. The Chic Half Round Knob With Rectangular Rose is a great combination of old and new with a traditional knob and a modern style rose. That makes it perfect for any home no matter the decor. It is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. Available in 7 finishes.",
                "keywords": "OMN-565RT Beveled Half Round Knobs, Omnia 565RT Chic Half Round Knob With Rectangular Rose, omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs, Omnia Standard door knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs, Beveled Half Round Knob with Rectangular Roses, Chic Half Round Knobs, Beveled Edge Half Round Knobsets, square roses,"
